    "At LogiMAT 2026 in Stuttgart, visitors explored our automation and digital solutions alongside innovative vehicles and energy concept - all under our motto: \"Composed Around You.\"",
    "In November, we brought together experts, customers, and partners from around Europe at our Linde Experience Hub in Aschaffenburg. The event highlighted our commitment to accessible, cost‑effective automation tailored to your needs.",
    "Thrilling action, top‑level competition, and the world’s best forklift community – that’s the StaplerCup. Watch the best drivers compete live at the StaplerCup Finals at the LINDE MH ARENA in Aschaffenburg.",
    "Driven by the motto “Vision ZERO. Safety in your world,” we attended the A+A in Düsseldorf. At the international trade fair and congress for personal protection and occupational health and safety, Linde MH presented a range of solutions, including the Reverse Assist Radar assistance system.",
    "From June 20–30, we had the pleasure of welcoming large numbers of visitors from around the world to the Mannheim May Market. In the spirit of the tagline “YOUR WAY IS OUR WAY”, our guests had the opportunity to test all of the trucks, technologies, and tools on offer from Linde MH and its partners.",
